{
 "description": "Virtual time: the decoder's data plane is lost, so every WRITE of the prefiller's fails and each three consecutive failures fault the peer. Three faults give reconnect waits of 0, 1 s and 2 s (a fault within the max of the previous wait's end doubles it). A connection 1.5 s after the third fault is inside the 2 s wait: it is refused with a DisconnectMsg and the request's lookups MISS. One second later a new connection is accepted.",
